              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जुलूस (jalūs) (julūs) is a loan from Arabic julūs, \"a sitting; enthronement\", which reached Hindi through Persian. Its Arabic root is j-l-s (Lane). Hindi uses it for the procession that went with it."
            }
